@ECommerce.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5296

### Health
GET {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### US-2 - list categories (public)
GET {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### US-2 - get one category (public)
GET {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories/1
Accept: application/json

### US-2 - create a category (Admin only)
# Replace <admin-jwt> with a token issued by the login endpoint once US-8 is available.
POST {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <admin-jwt>

{
  "name": "Books",
  "description": "Printed and digital books"
}

### US-2 - update a category (Admin only)
PUT {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <admin-jwt>

{
  "name": "Novels",
  "description": "Fiction only"
}

### US-2 - delete a category (Admin only)
DELETE {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer <admin-jwt>

###
